@startuml
title Farm Management System State Diagram

[*] --> Login
Login --> MainMenu : login successful
MainMenu --> MarketConditions : select market conditions
MarketConditions --> MarketReport : select market report
MarketConditions --> PestControlHelp : select pest control help
MainMenu --> SoilSuggestions : select soil suggestions
MainMenu --> WeatherInsights : select weather insights
MainMenu --> LabourAvailability : select labour availability
MainMenu --> Logout : select logout

PestControlHelp --> PhotoRequired : request photo
PhotoRequired --> PestControlTechniques : photo provided
PestControlTechniques --> MainMenu : continue using service

SoilSuggestions --> CropSuggestions : provide soil information
CropSuggestions --> MainMenu : continue using service

WeatherInsights --> WeatherData : provide location
WeatherData --> MainMenu : continue using service

LabourAvailability --> LabourDetails : provide location
LabourDetails --> MainMenu : continue using service

Logout --> [*] : end session

@enduml
